        <mxCell id="rules" value="Solid labeled arrows show selected FK cardinalities. Order/idempotency are required parents; initiating customer/staff fields are mutually constrained. History actor and workflow target references are typed logical references, not invented cross-table FKs. Approval alone does not cancel an order. Event and destination rows commit atomically; all lease completions are fenced. See data dictionary for fields and integrity document for guards." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontSize=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#667788;">
